<meta property="og:description" content="The Central Credit Register (CCR) is a database operated by the Central Bank of Ireland under the Credit Reporting Act 2013. It stores personal and credit information on loans of &#x20AC;500 or more and produces credit reports on request to lenders and borrowers. Applications can be made online for a credit report, to request an amendment to information on your credit report, to place an explanatory statement on your credit report, to place a notice of suspected impersonation on your credit report.">
